# Environment variables for Vercel

Set these in Vercel Project Settings -> Environment Variables:

- `FAL_KEY`
- `FAL_MODEL` = `fal-ai/flux/dev`
- `CREEM_API_KEY`
- `CREEM_PRODUCT_STARTER` (Creem product id for the Starter plan)
- `CREEM_PRODUCT_CREATOR` (Creem product id for the Creator plan)
- `CREEM_PRODUCT_PRO` (Creem product id for the Pro plan)
- `CREEM_PRODUCT_BUSINESS` (Creem product id for the Business plan)
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL`
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`
- `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL`

Do not commit real production secrets to GitHub.
